    "preamble": "C K Babu vs Kaiparambu Grama Panchayat on 19 January, 2026 Author: P.V.Kunhikrishnan Bench: P.V.Kunhikrishnan Wp(C) No. 44659 Of 2025 1 2026:Ker:4206 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.V.Kunhikrishnan Monday, The 19Th Day Of January 2026 / 29Th Pousha, 1947 Wp(C) No. 44659 Of 2025 Petitioner/S: C K Babu Aged 64 Years S/O Chovallur Kochappan, Anjoor Village, Mundoor Desom, Mundoor P.O, Thrissur, Pin - 680541 By Advs. Sri.Rajit Smt.Sruthi Rajit Respondents: 1 Kaiparambu Grama Panchayat Mundoor P.O, Thrissur Represented By The Secretary, Pin - 680541 2 Secretary Kaiparambu Grama Panchayat, Mundoor P.O, Thrissur, Pin - 680541 3 Station House Officer Peramangalam Police Station, Thrissur District, Pin - 680545",
    "facts": "In the meanwhile, if the hotel of respondents 4 and 5 is functioning without the requisite license, the Panchayat shall take emergent measures to close down the hotel.\" 3. Thereafter an application was filed by respondents 2026:KER:4206 4 and 5 to vacate the above order by filing I.A No.1/2026. That application was dismissed by this Court on 13.01.2026. The counsel appearing for the applicant in this Interlocutory application submitted that, he has got deemed license. The same is objected by the Writ Petitioner. According to the petitioner, Ext.P11 make out cognizable offences.",
